# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
artifacts/
TestResults/
coverage/
# 文档型 coverage 目录(完成度审计)需要跟踪,不受测试覆盖率规则影响。
!docs/coverage/
!docs/coverage/**
docs/plans/

# IDE and user files
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Local (machine-specific) test configuration. The IP/credentials/`Enabled` flag
# are per-developer and must not be tracked; template the real values instead.
tests/**/appsettings.local.json

# Local standard documents and unprocessed captures may be proprietary or large.
references/standards/**
references/captures/raw/**
references/legacy/**

# The currently supplied Impinj definition declares itself confidential and
# proprietary. Keep it local until redistribution/commit rights are confirmed.
definitions/imports/xml/extensions/impinj/**

# Keep directory guidance files tracked.
!references/standards/README.md
!references/captures/raw/.gitkeep
!references/legacy/.gitkeep

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
/.tmp-generated
/tmp/pdfs/itemtest-review
/.reasonix
scratch/
